    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62465" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπρ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>have</i> or <i>catch leprosy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Nu.</u>
				12.10
			</span></i>; <i>become scaly</i> or <i>rough</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. τὴν κύστιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					5.17
				</span></i>
			 (cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Aph.</u>
				4.77
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ῥάκιν λελέπρηκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herod.
					3.50
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπρᾶν κεράμιον ὀξηρόν</span>
			the vinegar-jar <i>is mouldy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				723
			</span></i>.</div>
